## Time Zone

- All times in **Asia/Tehran** timezone
- Use `src/lib/tehran-time.ts` for conversions
- Database stores UTC, display converts to Tehran time

## Calendar System

- **Jalali (Persian) calendar** for UI display
- Use `jalaali-js` library
- Helper functions in `src/lib/jalali.ts`
- Week starts on **Saturday** (Persian convention)

## Date Libraries

- `dayjs` for date manipulation
- `@mantine/dates` for date pickers (with Jalali conversion)
